    "description": "Assess, test and validate defenses the way an adversary would.\n\n## What's inside\n\n- **Cisco Certificate in Ethical Hacking** (NETACAD ETHICAL HACKER + CISCO U. CTF) - The penetration-testing process from scoping and recon to exploitation, reporting and CTF practice. *15 lessons.*\n- **Vulnerability Discovery & Security Assessment** - Finding, prioritising and fixing vulnerabilities - and proving they are fixed. *22 lessons.*\n- **Advanced Offensive Testing for Defense** - Thinking and testing like an adversary to validate defenses. *20 lessons.*\n\n## How lessons work\n\nEach lesson combines a written explanation with animated diagrams of the process it describes, annotated code and command-line sessions, key terms, and a short *Check your understanding* quiz. Lessons marked *coming soon* are part of the syllabus and are being written."
